{"id":"a2-business","title":"A2 · Business","level":"A2","kind":"business","description":"Office basics — introductions, phone calls, emails, appointments and the rhythm of a German workday.","passages":[{"id":"a2w-01","title":"Der erste Arbeitstag","title_en":"The First Day at Work","tags":["office","introductions"],"sentences":[{"en":"Today is my first day at work at the Becker company.","tokens":[{"w":"Heute","en":"today","d":"heute","p":"adv"},{"w":"ist","en":"is","d":"sein","p":"v","n":"er/sie/es ist"},{"w":"mein","en":"my","p":"pron"},{"w":"erster","en":"first","d":"erst-","p":"adj"},{"w":"Arbeitstag","en":"working day","d":"der Arbeitstag, die Arbeitstage","g":"m","p":"m"},{"w":"bei","en":"at; with; at the place of","p":"prep"},{"w":"der","en":"the (m.; dative f.)","p":"art"},{"w":"Firma","en":"company; firm","d":"die Firma, die Firmen","g":"f","p":"f"},{"w":"Becker","en":"Becker (surname)","p":"name"},{"w":"."}]},{"en":"My boss shows me the office and introduces the team to me.","tokens":[{"w":"Meine","en":"my","d":"mein","p":"pron"},{"w":"Chefin","en":"boss (woman)","d":"die Chefin, die Chefinnen","g":"f","p":"f"},{"w":"zeigt","en":"shows","d":"zeigen","p":"v","n":"er/sie/man zeigt"},{"w":"mir","en":"me; to me","d":"ich","p":"pron"},{"w":"das","en":"the (neuter); that; this","p":"art"},{"w":"Büro","en":"office","d":"das Büro, die Büros","g":"n","p":"n"},{"w":"und","en":"and","p":"conj"},{"w":"stellt","en":"introduces","d":"vorstellen","p":"v","n":"separable: sie stellt … vor"},{"w":"mir","en":"me; to me","d":"ich","p":"pron"},{"w":"das","en":"the (neuter); that; this","p":"art"},{"w":"Team","en":"team","d":"das Team, die Teams","g":"n","p":"n"},{"w":"vor","en":"verb prefix; completes the verb earlier in the sentence","d":"vor- (separable prefix)","p":"part"},{"w":"."}]},{"en":"This is Mr. Wagner. He heads the marketing department.","tokens":[{"w":"Das","en":"the (neuter); that; this","d":"das","p":"art"},{"w":"ist","en":"is","d":"sein","p":"v","n":"er/sie/e